
  my2cents workspace sandbox (Lambda MicroVM, Claude Code 2.1.317)

    claude        Claude Code, ready to go: no login, no prompts (bypass permissions mode)
    /root/work    working directory, trusted by Claude Code
    tmux "main"   this session survives suspend/resume and reconnects; C-b d detaches

  All egress goes through iron-proxy: only allowlisted hosts answer, and the API keys here
  are placeholders that the proxy swaps for the real ones on the way out.

